<div class="py-16 max-w-xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-10 border border-stone-200 shadow-xl space-y-6">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto shadow-inner">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">¡Gracias por apoyar el campo!</span>
            <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-stone-900">Pedido Recibido con Éxito</h1>
            <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 mt-2">
                Número de Pedido: <span class="font-bold text-coffee-900">#<%= order.id %></span>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-left text-xs space-y-3 border border-stone-200">
            <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-stone-200 pb-2">
                <span class="text-stone-500">Destinatario:</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-stone-800"><%= order.customer_name %></span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-stone-200 pb-2">
                <span class="text-stone-500">Dirección:</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-stone-800"><%= order.shipping_address %></span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-stone-200 pb-2">
                <span class="text-stone-500">Total a Pagar:</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-coffee-950 font-serif text-sm">$<%= order.total.toLocaleString('es-CO') %> COP</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
                <span class="text-stone-500">Estado del Pedido:</span>
                <span class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase text-[10px]">
                    <%= order.status === 'pending' ? 'En cola para tueste' : order.status %>
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed">
            Hemos registrado tu pedido en la finca. Tostamos en baches pequeños para garantizar máxima frescura aromática.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
            <a href="/tienda" class="bg-coffee-900 hover:bg-coffee-800 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full transition">
                Volver a la Tienda
            </a>
            <% if (user) { %>
                <a href="/cuenta" class="bg-stone-100 hover:bg-stone-200 text-stone-800 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full transition">
                    Ver mis pedidos
                </a>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
